---
comment: "MONSTER_HP enriched + tier 태그 hide (#359: 통합 cv_monsterPanel로 대체. Lua가 [SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N name]을 [SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N [tier]name (cur/max)] enriched로 replacement하므로 raw 노출 차단용 hide 필수)"
type: editdisplay
ableFlag: true
flag: g
---
@@@ IN
\[SYSTEM\|MONSTER_HP:([+\-]?\d+)\s+\[([NEB])\]\s*(.+)\s+\((\d+)/(\d+)\)\]
@@@ OUT
<div style="margin:6px auto;max-width:520px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(245,251,255,0.97);border:1.5px solid rgba(45,108,176,0.45);box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(45,108,176,0.12);font-family:'Segoe UI','Apple SD Gothic Neo',sans-serif;font-size:0.85em;"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px;gap:8px;"><span style="font-weight:700;color:#2d6cb0;letter-spacing:0.3px;"><span style="display:inline-block;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(45,108,176,0.12);color:#2d6cb0;font-size:0.78em;margin-right:5px;">{{#when::$2::is::N}}⭐{{/when}}{{#when::$2::is::E}}⭐⭐{{/when}}{{#when::$2::is::B}}⭐⭐⭐{{/when}}</span>$3</span><span style="font-size:0.85em;color:#cc4444;font-weight:700;background:rgba(204,68,68,0.08);padding:1px 7px;border-radius:4px;">$1</span></div><div style="width:100%;height:9px;background:rgba(45,108,176,0.12);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;position:relative;"><div style="width:{{? $4 / $5 * 100}}%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff7e7e,#cc4444);transition:width 0.4s ease;"></div></div><div style="font-size:0.74em;color:#5a7eae;margin-top:3px;text-align:right;font-family:'Segoe UI',monospace;">$4 / $5</div></div>
